<BaseLayout title="Power Steering" description="Power steering options for LS Genesis Coupe swaps.">
  <h1>Power Steering</h1>
  <p>
    You can keep the factory hydraulic rack or switch to electric.
  </p>

  <h2>Options</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Hydraulic with reducer</strong> — keep the factory rack and use a pressure reducer + adapter fittings from the LS pump.</li>
    <li><strong>Electric power steering</strong> — popular for cleaner packaging and no belt-driven pump. Several aftermarket kits exist.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    LOJ and Sikky both offer power steering line adapters for the Gen Coupe rack.
  </p>

